{"schema":"dasa_pada_text","default_author":"ಬಾಗೇಪಲ್ಲಿ ಶೇಷದಾಸರು","composer":"ಬಾಗೇಪಲ್ಲಿ ಶೇಷದಾಸರು","count":28,"bio_notes":"","items":[{"id":"bagepalli_sesadasaru__dasa1_8524","form":"pada","form_confidence":"default bucket, not a positive signal","title":{"kn":"ಅಂಬುಜಮುಖಿಯರು","latin":"","iast":"aṃbujamukhiyaru","devanagari":"अंबुजमुखियरु"},"composer":"ಬಾಗೇಪಲ್ಲಿ ಶೇಷದಾಸರು","composer_iast":"bāgepalli śeṣadāsaru","deity":"","tags":["composer:ಬಾಗೇಪಲ್ಲಿ ಶೇಷದಾಸರು","source:android_app_local:dasa1","category_raw:0","form:pada"],"raga":"","tala":"","singer":"","style":"","music_director":"","studio":"","language":"kn","text":{"kannada":[["ಉತ್ಸವ ಕಾಲದಲ್ಲಿ","ಭಗವನ್ನಾಮ","ಅಂಬುಜ ಮುಖಿಯರು ಕಂಬುಕಂಠೆಯರು","ಅಂಬರದಲಿ ನಾಟ್ಯವಾಡಿದರು ಪ","ಕುಂಭಿಣಿ ಪತಿ ಶ್ರೀ ಕೃಷ್ಣನರಥ ಬರೆ","ಸಂಭ್ರಮದಿಂದಲಿ ಪಾಡಿದರು ಅ.ಪ.","ಬಾಜ ಬಜಂತ್ರಿಯ ವಾದ್ಯರಭಸದೊಳು","ಮೋಜಿನಿಂದಲಿ ಹರಿ ಬರುತಿರಲು","ಸೋಜಿಗ ಪಡುತಲಿ ರಾಜ ವದನೆಯರು","ಜಾಜಿಮಲ್ಲಿಗೆ ಹೂವ ಬೀರಿದರು","ವೇದ ಘೋಷಗಳಿಂದ ಮೋದಪಡುತ ಹರಿ","ಸಾಧುಜನರ ಕೂಡಿ ಸರಸದಲಿ","ಬೀದಿಯೊಳ್ ಬರುತಿರೆ ಮಾಧವರಾಯಗೆ","ಸೂಜಿಮಲ್ಲಿಗೆ ಹೂವ ಬೀರಿದರು","ಕನ್ನಡಿ ಮಂಟಪ ಮಧ್ಯದೊಳಗೆ ಹರಿ","ರನ್ನೆಯರೊಡಗೊಡಿ ಬರುತಿರಲು","ಸನ್ನುತಾಂಗ ಶಿರಿ ಪ್ರಾಣನಾಥ ವಿಠಲನ","ಸಂಭ್ರಮದಿಂದಲಿ ಸಾರಿದರು"]],"iast":[],"devanagari":[],"source_roman":[]},"meaning":"","source":{"site":"android_app_local_asset:dasa1","url":"","attribution":"Imported from a local Android app database asset (dasa1); non-commercial dharma-prachara / education / research.","fetched":"2026-08-19"},"app_meta":{"asset":"dasa1","dasaru_id":165,"keerthana_id":8524,"category_raw":0,"favorite":false,"header_stripped":["ಬಾಗೇಪಲ್ಲಿ ಶೇಷದಾಸರು"],"unclassified_lines":[],"is_recorded_rendition":false},"_needs_review":false,"also_at":[]},{"id":"bagepalli_sesadasaru__dasa1_8525","form":"pada","form_confidence":"default bucket, not a positive signal","title":{"kn":"ಆರತಿಯನೆತ್ತುವೆನು ವಾರಿಜಾಕ್ಷ ಕೃಷ್ಣ ನಿನಗೆ","latin":"","iast":"āratiyanèttuvènu vārijākṣa kṛṣṇa ninagè","devanagari":"आरतियनॆत्तुवॆनु वारिजाक्ष कृष्ण निनगॆ"},"composer":"ಬಾಗೇಪಲ್ಲಿ ಶೇಷದಾಸರು","composer_iast":"bāgepalli śeṣadāsaru","deity":"","tags":["composer:ಬಾಗೇಪಲ್ಲಿ ಶೇಷದಾಸರು","source:android_app_local:dasa1","category_raw:0","form:pada"],"raga":"","tala":"","singer":"","style":"","music_director":"","studio":"","language":"kn","text":{"kannada":[["ಶ್ರೀ ಲಕ್ಷ್ಮೀದೇವಿಯು","ಆರತಿಯನೆತ್ತುವೆನು ವಾರಿಜಾಕ್ಷ ಕೃಷ್ಣ ನಿನಗೆ ಪ","ತಾಮರಸದಳಾಕ್ಷ ನಿನಗೆ ಹೇಮದ ತಟ್ಟಿಯನು ಪಿಡಿದು ಅ.ಪ","ಮಾರಸುಂದರ ಮೋಹನಾಂಗ ಸಾರಸಾಕ್ಷ ಕೃಪಾಪಾಂಗ","ನಾರಿಜನರ ಮತ್ತಭೃಂಗ ಧೀರ ಮಂಗಳಾಂಗ ನಿನಗೆ","ಕಮಲ ನಯನ ಹರಿಯೆ ನಿನಗೆ ವಿಮಲಮುತ್ತಿನ ಆರತಿಯ","ಕಮಲ ಮುಖಿಯು ಕರದಿ ಪಿಡಿದು ಕಮಲವದನ ಕೃಷ್ಣ ನಿನಗೆ","ಜಾಣ ಪ್ರಾಣನಾಥ ವಿಠಲ ಆಣಿ ಮುತ್ತಿನ ಆರತಿಯ","ಜಾಣತನದಿ ಕರದಿ ಪಿಡಿದು ಪ್ರಾಣಕಾಂತ ಕೃಷ್ಣ ನಿನಗೆ"]],"iast":[],"devanagari":[],"source_roman":[]},"meaning":"","source":{"site":"android_app_local_asset:dasa1","url":"","attribution":"Imported from a local Android app database asset (dasa1); non-commercial dharma-prachara / education / research.","fetched":"2026-08-19"},"app_meta":{"asset":"dasa1","dasaru_id":165,"keerthana_id":8525,"category_raw":0,"favorite":false,"header_stripped":["ಬಾಗೇಪಲ್ಲಿ ಶೇಷದಾಸರು"],"unclassified_lines":[],"is_recorded_rendition":false},"_needs_review":false,"also_at":[]},{"id":"bagepalli_sesadasaru__dasa1_8526","form":"pada","form_confidence":"default bucket, not a positive signal","title":{"kn":"ಉಮೇಶಾ ಪರಿಪಾಲಿಸೊ","latin":"","iast":"umeśā paripālisò","devanagari":"उमेशा परिपालिसॊ"},"composer":"ಬಾಗೇಪಲ್ಲಿ ಶೇಷದಾಸರು","composer_iast":"bāgepalli śeṣadāsaru","deity":"","tags":["composer:ಬಾಗೇಪಲ್ಲಿ ಶೇಷದಾಸರು","source:android_app_local:dasa1","category_raw:0","form:pada"],"raga":"","tala":"","singer":"","style":"","music_director":"","studio":"","language":"kn","text":{"kannada":[["ಇದು ಉಮೆಯ ಪತಿಯಾದ","ರುದ್ರದೇವರು","ಉಮೇಶಾ ಪರಿಪಾಲಿಸೊ ಪ","ಉಮೇಶ ಪಾಲಿಸು ರಮೇಶನ ಪಾದ","ಕಮಲಗಳಿಗೆ ಭ್ರಮರನೆನಿಸಿ","ಕಾಲನಿಯಾಮಕ ನೀನಾಗಿ ಜಗವನು","ಲೀಲೆಯಿಂದಲಿ ಕಾವ ಶೂಲ ಪಾಣಿಯೆ","ಈಶವಂದಿತ ಸಿರಿ ಶೇಷಾವಿಠ್ಠಲನ","ದಾಸನೆನಿಸಿ ಸಂತೋಷಗೊಳಿಸೊ"]],"iast":[],"devanagari":[],"source_roman":[]},"meaning":"","source":{"site":"android_app_local_asset:dasa1","url":"","attribution":"Imported from a local Android app database asset (dasa1); non-commercial dharma-prachara / education / research.","fetched":"2026-08-19"},"app_meta":{"asset":"dasa1","dasaru_id":165,"keerthana_id":8526,"category_raw":0,"favorite":false,"header_stripped":["ಬಾಗೇಪಲ್ಲಿ ಶೇಷದಾಸರು"],"unclassified_lines":[],"is_recorded_rendition":false},"_needs_review":false,"also_at":[]},{"id":"bagepalli_sesadasaru__dasa1_8527","form":"pada","form_confidence":"default bucket, not a positive signal","title":{"kn":"ಎಲ್ಲಿರುವೆ ತಂದೆ ಬಾರೊ ಮಾರುತಿ","latin":"","iast":"èlliruvè taṃdè bārò māruti","devanagari":"ऎल्लिरुवॆ तंदॆ बारॊ मारुति"},"composer":"ಬಾಗೇಪಲ್ಲಿ ಶೇಷದಾಸರು","composer_iast":"bāgepalli śeṣadāsaru","deity":"","tags":["composer:ಬಾಗೇಪಲ್ಲಿ ಶೇಷದಾಸರು","source:android_app_local:dasa1","category_raw:0","form:pada"],"raga":"","tala":"","singer":"","style":"","music_director":"","studio":"","language":"kn","text":{"kannada":[["ಇದು ಶ್ರೀ ಪ್ರಾಣದೇವನ","ವಾಯುದೇವರು","ಎಲ್ಲಿರುವೆ ತಂದೆ ಬಾರೊ ಮಾರುತಿ ಪ","ಎಲ್ಲೆಲ್ಲಿನೋಡಿದರು ಅಲ್ಲಿ ನಿನ್ನ ಕೀರುತಿ","ಅಲ್ಲಿನಿನ್ನಕೂಡಿರುವ ನಿತ್ಯಾಶ್ರೀಪತಿಅ.ಪ","ವಾರಿಧಿಯ ಹಾರಿ ನೀ ಸೇರಿ ತ್ವರದಿ ಲಂಕೆಯ","ಕ್ರೂರರನ್ನು ಕೊಂದು ಕುರುಹ ತಂದ ಮಹರಾಯ","ದುರುಳ ಕುರುಪನನ್ನು ಕೊಂದು ತರಳೆಯಮಾನ","ಹರುಷದಿಂದ ಪೊರೆದು ನೀ ಮೆರೆದ್ಯೊ ಸುಮ್ಮಾನ","ಯತಿಯ ರೂಪವ ಧರಿಸಿ ನೀ ಸಿರಿಪತಿಯ ಪಾದವ","ಹಿತದಿ ಸತತ ಭಜಿಸಿ ಶೇಷ ವಿಠ್ಠಲನ ಮೋದಿಸಿದಿ"]],"iast":[],"devanagari":[],"source_roman":[]},"meaning":"","source":{"site":"android_app_local_asset:dasa1","url":"","attribution":"Imported from a local Android app database asset (dasa1); non-commercial dharma-prachara / education / research.","fetched":"2026-08-19"},"app_meta":{"asset":"dasa1","dasaru_id":165,"keerthana_id":8527,"category_raw":0,"favorite":false,"header_stripped":["ಬಾಗೇಪಲ್ಲಿ ಶೇಷದಾಸರು"],"unclassified_lines":[],"is_recorded_rendition":false},"_needs_review":false,"also_at":[]},{"id":"bagepalli_sesadasaru__dasa1_8528","form":"pada","form_confidence":"default bucket, not a positive signal","title":{"kn":"ಕರಿರಾಜ ವರದ ಕಾಯೊ","latin":"","iast":"karirāja varada kāyò","devanagari":"करिराज वरद कायॊ"},"composer":"ಬಾಗೇಪಲ್ಲಿ ಶೇಷದಾಸರು","composer_iast":"bāgepalli śeṣadāsaru","deity":"","tags":["composer:ಬಾಗೇಪಲ್ಲಿ ಶೇಷದಾಸರು","source:android_app_local:dasa1","category_raw:0","form:pada"],"raga":"","tala":"","singer":"","style":"","music_director":"","studio":"","language":"kn","text":{"kannada":[["ಗಜೇಂದ್ರನ್ನು ಕಾಪಾಡಿದ","ಕರಿರಾಜ ವರದ ಕಾಯೊ ಪ","ವರ ಕರಿರಾಜ ವರದ ಕಾಯೊ","ಮರೆಯದೆ ಎನ್ನ ಕರವ ಪಿಡಿದು","ವರಕರಿರಾಜವರದ ಕಾಯೊ","ಶರಣರ ಚರಣ ಸ್ಮರಣೆಯ ಕರುಣಿಸಿ","ದೀನವತ್ಸಲ ಸಿರಿ ಪ್ರಾಣನಾಥ ವಿಠ್ಠಲ","ನಿನ್ನಧ್ಯಾನ ಕೊಟ್ಟೆನ್ನ ಕಾಯೊ"]],"iast":[],"devanagari":[],"source_roman":[]},"meaning":"","source":{"site":"android_app_local_asset:dasa1","url":"","attribution":"Imported from a local Android app database asset (dasa1); non-commercial dharma-prachara / education / research.","fetched":"2026-08-19"},"app_meta":{"asset":"dasa1","dasaru_id":165,"keerthana_id":8528,"category_raw":0,"favorite":false,"header_stripped":["ಬಾಗೇಪಲ್ಲಿ ಶೇಷದಾಸರು"],"unclassified_lines":[],"is_recorded_rendition":false},"_needs_review":false,"also_at":[]},{"id":"bagepalli_sesadasaru__dasa1_8529","form":"pada","form_confidence":"default bucket, not a positive signal","title":{"kn":"ಕಾಂತಾಮಣಿ ಶ್ರೀ ರುಕ್ಮಿಣಿ","latin":"","iast":"kāṃtāmaṇi śrī rukmiṇi","devanagari":"कांतामणि श्री रुक्मिणि"},"composer":"ಬಾಗೇಪಲ್ಲಿ ಶೇಷದಾಸರು","composer_iast":"bāgepalli śeṣadāsaru","deity":"","tags":["composer:ಬಾಗೇಪಲ್ಲಿ ಶೇಷದಾಸರು","source:android_app_local:dasa1","category_raw:0","form:pada"],"raga":"","tala":"","singer":"","style":"","music_director":"","studio":"","language":"kn","text":{"kannada":[["ಇದು ರುಕ್ಮಿಣಿಯ ಸ್ತೋತ್ರ","ಕಾಂತಾಮಣಿ ಶ್ರೀ ರುಕ್ಮಿಣಿ ಪ","ವದನ ಸುಶೀಲೆ ಮೃಗಮದ ಫಾಲೆ","ಸದಯೆ ನೀ ಭಕ್ತರ ಮುದದಿ ಪಾಲಿಸು ಇನ್ನು","ಜಗದ ಜನನಿಯೆ ನೀ ಬಗೆ ಬಗೆಯಿಂದಲಿ","ನಗೆ ಮುಖ ಪ್ರಾಣನಾಥ ವಿಠಲನ ಬದಿಯೊಳಿಪ್ಪೆ","(ಸೂಚನೆ:ಈ ಪದದ ಎರಡನೇ ನುಡಿ ದೊರೆತಿಲ್ಲ _ಸಂ.)"]],"iast":[],"devanagari":[],"source_roman":[]},"meaning":"","source":{"site":"android_app_local_asset:dasa1","url":"","attribution":"Imported from a local Android app database asset (dasa1); non-commercial dharma-prachara / education / research.","fetched":"2026-08-19"},"app_meta":{"asset":"dasa1","dasaru_id":165,"keerthana_id":8529,"category_raw":0,"favorite":false,"header_stripped":["ಬಾಗೇಪಲ್ಲಿ ಶೇಷದಾಸರು"],"unclassified_lines":["-----------------------","-----------------------"],"is_recorded_rendition":false},"_needs_review":true,"also_at":[]},{"id":"bagepalli_sesadasaru__dasa1_8530","form":"pada","form_confidence":"default bucket, not a positive signal","title":{"kn":"ಕೈಪಿಡಿದು ಪಾಲಿಸೈ ಬ್ರಹ್ಮಣ್ಯಗುರುವೇ","latin":"","iast":"kaipiḍidu pālisai brahmaṇyaguruve","devanagari":"कैपिडिदु पालिसै ब्रह्मण्यगुरुवे"},"composer":"ಬಾಗೇಪಲ್ಲಿ ಶೇಷದಾಸರು","composer_iast":"bāgepalli śeṣadāsaru","deity":"","tags":["composer:ಬಾಗೇಪಲ್ಲಿ ಶೇಷದಾಸರು","source:android_app_local:dasa1","category_raw:0","form:pada"],"raga":"","tala":"","singer":"","style":"","music_director":"","studio":"","language":"kn","text":{"kannada":[["ಇದು ಶ್ರೀ ವ್ಯಾಸತೀರ್ಥರ","ಯತಿಗಳು (ಶ್ರೀ ಬ್ರಹ್ಮಣ್ಯತೀರ್ಥರು)","ಕೈಪಿಡಿದು ಪಾಲಿಸೈ ಬ್ರಹ್ಮಣ್ಯಗುರುವೇ ಪ","ಅಯ್ಯನೀನೆಂದು ನಿನ್ನಡಿಗೆ ವಂದಿಸುವೇ ಅ.ಪ","ಮೂಢವiತಿಗಳು ಬಂದು ಬೇಡಿ ಕೊಳ್ಳಲು ಕರುಣ","ನೀಡಿ ನಿನ್ನವರನ್ನು ಕಾಯ್ದರೀತಿ","ಗಾಢದಿಂದಲಿ ಬಂದು ಮೂಢನಾದೆನ್ನನು","ಗೂಢದಿಂದಲಿ ಕಾಯೊ ಗುಣನಿಧಿಯೆ ಗುರುವೇ . .","ಪುರುಷೋತ್ತಮಾರ್ಯರ ವರಪುತ್ರನೆಂದೆನಿಸಿ","ಹರುಷದಿಂದಲಿ ಬಂದ ಭಕ್ತಜನರ","ಮೊರೆಯಲಾಲಿಸಿ ಸ್ವಾಮಿ ಸ್ಮರಣೆಯ ಕೊಟ್ಟೆನ್ನ","ಹರುಷಪಡಿಸುವ ಗುರುವು ನೀನೆಂದು ನಾ ಬಂದೆ","ವರಕಣ್ವನದಿ ಕೂಲದಲಿ ಕಲ್ಮಷ ತೊಳೆದು","ಪರ್ಮೆಯಿಂದಲಿ ಶಿಶುವ ಪಾಲಿಸಿದ ಗುರುವೆ","ಸಾರ್ವಭೌಮನ ಗುಣವ ಸರ್ವದಾ ಪಾಡುತಲಿ","ಸರ್ವಜನರನು ಕಾವೆ ಸರ್ವಕಾಲದಲಿ","ಸರ್ವಗುಣ ಪೂರ್ಣ ಬ್ರಹ್ಮಣ್ಯಪುರ ವಾಸ","ನರಹರಿಯ ಪಾದವನು ಸ್ಮರಿಸಿನಿತ್ಯ","ಸರಸದಲಿ ಅಬ್ಬೂರು ಪುರವಾಸಿಗಳನೆಲ್ಲ","ಅರ್ಭಕರ ತೆರನಂತೆ ರಕ್ಷಿಸುವ ಗುರುವರ್ಯ","ಮಣಿದು ಬೇಡುವೆ ನಿನ್ನ ಚರಣದಾಶ್ರಯವಿತ್ತು","ಅಣುಗನೆಂದೆನಿಸೆನ್ನ ಸಲಹಬೇಕೊ","ಗುಣನಿಧಿ ಶ್ರೀ ಪ್ರಾಣನಾಥ ವಿಠ್ಠಲನ","ಘನ ಚರಣ ಸ್ಮರಣೆಯ ನೀಯೊ ಗುರುವೆ"]],"iast":[],"devanagari":[],"source_roman":[]},"meaning":"","source":{"site":"android_app_local_asset:dasa1","url":"","attribution":"Imported from a local Android app database asset (dasa1); non-commercial dharma-prachara / education / research.","fetched":"2026-08-19"},"app_meta":{"asset":"dasa1","dasaru_id":165,"keerthana_id":8530,"category_raw":0,"favorite":false,"header_stripped":["ಬಾಗೇಪಲ್ಲಿ ಶೇಷದಾಸರು"],"unclassified_lines":[],"is_recorded_rendition":false},"_needs_review":false,"also_at":[]},{"id":"bagepalli_sesadasaru__dasa1